**Cause:** Lines 1603-1607 checked `maxsplit == 0` *before* decrementing it, so the first separator consumed no budget and a second separator was still allowed.

**Fix:** Decrement `maxsplit` immediately after yielding (line 1603), then check for zero on the next separator. This ensures each split consumes one unit of the budget.